### 4. `XF86MonBrightnessUp` / `XF86MonBrightnessDown` Duplicate

* **Lines 26 & 27:**
```sway
bindsym XF86MonBrightnessUp   exec $qsIpc brightness increment
bindsym XF86MonBrightnessDown exec $qsIpc brightness decrement
```[cite: 11]

```


* **Lines 144 & 145:**
```sway
bindsym XF86MonBrightnessUp   exec brightnessctl set +10%
bindsym XF86MonBrightnessDown exec brightnessctl set  10%-
```[cite: 11]


```



**Fix:** Comment out or delete lines 144–145 so only Quickshell's IPC controls monitor brightness:

```sway
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  BRIGHTNESS
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# bindsym XF86MonBrightnessUp   exec brightnessctl set +10%
# bindsym XF86MonBrightnessDown exec brightnessctl set  10%-

```

