### Verification Strategy

After saving the edits, test the config for duplicate bindings directly from your terminal:

```bash
swaymsg reload

```

If Sway still flags errors, run this command to print any remaining duplicate definitions in your configuration stack:

```bash
swaymsg -t get_bindings | grep -E "mod\+|XF86" | sort | uniq -d

```
